aciahkhia = (i:1) (t:v) (f:travel/everyday) (w:leave/go home/depart) (d:<a> and <ciahkhia>, leave for home, written as one word: he or they left, or the one who leaves) (j:a/ciahkhia) (r:zd:14699/zd:11389/zd:21338) (q:draft)
