acihpa = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/media) (w:the man called/the so-called/the man said to be) (d:<a> and <cihpa>, the one spoken of, written as one word after a name or a description: the man who goes by that name or is said to be that) (j:a/cihpa) (r:zd:15698/zd:16332) (q:draft)
acihpen = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday/media) (w:what is said/what is called/the so-called) (d:<a>, <cih>, say, and the topic marker <pen> written as one word, placed after quoted words or a name: what he said, or the thing that is called so, as the topic of the sentence) (j:a/cih/pen) (r:zd:12093/zd:13270) (q:draft)
acihte = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:what is called/the so-called) (d:<a> and <cihte> written as one word, placed after a name or a term: the things or people that are called so) (j:a/cihte) (r:zd:11371/zd:15465/zd:20545) (q:draft)
acii = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:its seed/its breed/its kind) (d:<a> with {cii}, seed, written as one word: the seed of a plant, and so the stock or kind of a thing or a people; {ameel-acii} is its look and kind) (r:zd:20959/zd:22827) (q:draft, low confidence)
