acim = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/nature) (w:collapse/cave in/fall down) (d:<a> and <cim> written as one word: it collapses, of a building or of earth that slides down) (j:a/cim) (r:zd:17628/zd:14679) (q:draft)
