aisa = (i:2) (t:n) (f:food/social) (w:feast meat) (d:in songs and festive speech paired with <ningzu>, rice beer: the meat of a feast; {ningzu aisa ne} is feast together. The meaning is taken from the pairing only) (r:zd:20131) (q:draft, low confidence)
aisan = (i:2) (t:v) (f:religion) (w:cast lots/divine) (d:the same word used as a verb, followed by <uh> or <in>: cast lots or read omens to find out or decide something) (r:zd:15384/zd:23928) (q:draft)
ait = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/family) (w:love/hold dear) (d:<a> and <it> written as one word: he loves, or the one who loves; {Zomi ait} is one who loves the Zomi) (j:a/it) (r:zd:23974/zd:24481) (q:draft)
aitam = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (w:I wonder) (d:word that ends a question and gives it a tone of wondering or doubt: I wonder, could it be; a form of everyday speech, compare <ahitam>) (r:zd:15926/zd:24289/zd:24427) (q:draft, low confidence)
aitang = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:representative/substitute/stand-in) (d:one who stands in the place of another or of a group; {aitang in} is on behalf of, in place of, and {aitang dingin} is to represent, to replace) (r:zd:17965/ts:5469/ts:10215) (q:draft)
aitangin = (i:1) (t:prep) (f:social/politics) (w:on behalf of/representing/in the name of) (d:<ai> and <tangin> written as one word, placed after the name of a group or land: acting or speaking for it, as its representative) (s:tangin) (j:ai/tangin) (r:zd:16340/zd:24171/zd:21161) (q:draft)
Aizawl = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (f:travel) (w:Aizawl) (d:capital city of Mizoram State in India) (r:zd:17168/ts:2349/zd:23856) (q:draft)
aizong = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:however/but/even so) (d:spoken form of {ahi zong}, though it is so: however, but, placed at the beginning of a sentence; repeated after two words it means whether the one or the other) (r:zd:17760/zd:23086/zd:26097) (q:draft)
aizongin = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:however/but/even so) (d:<aizong> with <in>, the spoken form of <ahizongin>: however, but; {bangbang aizongin} is whatever the case may be) (s:ahizongin) (b:aizong) (r:zd:11259/zd:16897) (q:draft)
