apuaklam = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday/travel) (w:that he was carrying) (d:<apuak> and <lam> written as one word: the fact that he or she carries or brings something, as the thing that is noticed, found or told) (j:apuak/lam) (r:zd:12146/zd:12274) (q:draft)
