asak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:consider/find/regard as) (d:<a> and <sak> written as one word, after a describing word: that someone finds or considers a thing to be so, as in {hoih asak}, what he finds good, and {thupi asak}, what he holds important) (j:a/sak) (r:zd:20406/zd:10973/zd:21701) (q:draft)
