atawng = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/media) (w:detail/small piece) (d:<a> and <tawng>, here a short piece, written as one word; used in {a neng atawng}, the small bits and pieces, that is the details, and {a neng atawng in}, in detail) (r:ts:9489/ts:3817/ts:10764) (q:draft, low confidence)
atawntung = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:forever/always/eternity) (d:<a> and <tawntung> written as one word: for all time, forever; often followed by <in> or <a>) (j:a/tawntung) (r:zd:21251/zd:23171) (q:draft)
