atna = (i:4) (t:n) (f:health) (w:surgery/operation) (d:in {ki atna}, the cutting open of a patient by a surgeon, and the place on the body that was cut; unlike {vun atna}, circumcision) (r:zd:12392/zd:12600) (q:draft)
