Auction = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work) (w:auction) (d:a public sale at which a thing goes to the one who offers the most; {auction in kizuak} is be sold by auction) (o:English) (r:zd:11373/zd:12470) (q:draft)
audio = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/it) (w:audio/sound recording) (d:recorded sound, as set against video or print) (o:English) (r:zd:24004/zd:23680/zd:24223) (q:draft)
audition = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media) (w:audition) (d:a trial performance by which singers are chosen for a contest) (o:English) (r:zd:23422/zd:23066) (q:draft)
auk = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/everyday) (w:rule/govern/control) (d:<a> and <uk> written as one word: he rules, the one who rules or controls) (j:a/uk) (r:zd:8668/zd:23670) (q:draft)
