Ausi = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel/politics) (w:Australia) (d:short everyday name of Australia) (o:English, Aussie) (r:zd:20818/zd:18234) (q:draft)
Aussie = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel) (w:Australia/Australian) (d:informal English name for Australia and for an Australian) (o:English) (r:zd:15535/zd:19800) (q:draft)
Austin = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (f:travel) (w:Austin) (d:city in the state of Texas, USA, where a Zomi community lives; the name is also part of other names of places and things) (r:zd:11666) (q:draft)
Australia = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel/politics) (w:Australia) (d:country and continent in the southern hemisphere where Zomi communities have settled) (r:zd:22076/zd:15726) (q:draft)
Australian = (i:1) (t:name) (c:people) (f:social) (w:Australian) (d:of Australia and its people; {Australian gammi} is an Australian citizen) (o:English) (r:zd:24042/zd:20416) (q:draft)
Austria = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel/politics) (w:Austria) (d:country in central Europe, with Vienna as its capital) (r:zd:17846/zd:11283) (q:draft)
aut = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:want/wish) (d:<a> and <ut> written as one word: he wants, what one wants; {aut peuhpeuh} is whatever one likes) (j:a/ut) (r:zd:23191/zd:19111) (q:draft)
