bangding = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:why/what for) (d:<bang>, what, and <ding> written as one word, mostly followed by <in> or <a>: for what purpose, why; the same spelling also stands for {bang ding}, will be like) (j:bang/ding) (r:zd:24058/zd:17437) (q:draft)
