banghanghiam = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:why) (d:<bang hang> and <hiam> written as one word: why; {banghanghiam cih leh}, literally if one asks why, means because) (j:bang hang/hiam) (r:zd:21011/zd:20892) (q:draft)
