Belpawlgam = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:politics) (w:Union/Union of Myanmar) (d:the Union, the state formed when the hill peoples and the Burmese plains joined together, in Burmese pyidaungsu; {Belpawlgam Ni} is Union Day, 12 February; also written {Belpawl gam}) (r:zd:22291/zd:22293/zd:22758) (q:draft)
Beltang = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (f:travel) (w:Beltang) (d:place and stream on the Tedim road in Chin State in Myanmar, the site of a hydropower station) (r:zd:24280/zd:23767) (q:draft, low confidence)
bem = (i:3) (t:num) (f:education/everyday) (w:zero/nought) (d:the figure 0, named from its round shape, and the point of having nothing: {bem panin kipan} is start from zero, {bem 10} is ten zeros) (s:Zero) (r:zd:15679/zd:24355/zd:24480) (q:draft)
bem = (i:4) (t:n) (f:home/nature) (w:tank/bin/reservoir) (d:a large round container or basin for storing, named by what it holds: {tui bem} is a water tank or reservoir, as <tuibem>, and {tang bem} a bin of millet) (r:zd:23016/zd:24595) (q:draft, low confidence)
benefit = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/politics) (w:benefit/allowance) (d:money or help that a government or an employer gives to a person, as in {Unemployment benefit}, pay for those out of work) (o:English) (r:zd:25325/zd:25925) (q:draft)
beng = (i:3) (t:n) (f:health/politics) (w:opium/opium poppy) (d:the poppy that is grown for opium, and the drug made from it; a noun, unlike the verbs hunt and slap, and brought out by <beng cinna> or {beng ciinna}, opium growing, {beng ciing}, grow opium, and {beng zuakna}, the opium trade) (s:zavom) (r:ts:3969/zd:15543/zd:14696) (q:draft)
