Bengal = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel) (w:Bengal) (d:region of South Asia; in the articles the Indian state of West Bengal and the Bay of Bengal) (r:ts:3506/zd:19846) (q:draft)
Bengali = (i:1) (t:name) (c:people) (f:social/politics) (w:Bengali) (d:the people of Bengal and Bangladesh and their language; in Myanmar also the name by which the Rohingya are officially called) (r:zd:24963/zd:24227) (q:draft)
benggawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/body) (w:beat up/slap hard/thrash) (d:<beng>, slap or strike, and <gawp>, severely, written as one word: slap or beat someone badly) (j:beng/gawp) (r:zd:19939/zd:15443) (q:draft)
