Berean = (i:1) (t:name) (f:religion/education) (w:Berean) (d:name of churches and Bible schools, after the people of Berea in the book of Acts who examined the Scriptures; in the articles a Bible college in Bangalore and a church in Kalaymyo) (r:zd:25572/zd:25616) (q:draft, low confidence)
