biakna makai = (i:1) (t:n) (f:religion/social) (w:religious leader/church leader) (d:<biakna>, religion, and <makai>, leader: a leader of a church or of a religion, named in public life beside {gam makai}, the leaders of the country) (r:zd:11159/zd:15259) (q:draft)
biakna pawlpite = (i:1) (t:n) (f:religion/social) (w:religious bodies/churches/denominations) (d:<biakna>, religion, and <pawlpite>, the plural of <pawlpi>: the churches and religious organisations of a people, named as one group of public life beside parties and associations) (r:zd:23903/zd:16224) (q:draft)
biakna sanginn = (i:1) (t:n) (f:religion/education) (w:religious school) (d:<biakna>, religion, and <sanginn>, school: a school run by a religious body where religion is taught, in the news mostly the Islamic boarding schools of Malaysia) (r:zd:15686/zd:15276) (q:draft)
