bu = (i:2) (t:n) (f:education/religion) (w:book/volume/copy) (d:a book as one bound volume, after the kind of book as in {laibu bu} and {Laisiangtho bu}, after the name of a book of the Bible as in {Daniel bu}, and as the counting word for books before a number; not {bu}, hide) (s:laibu) (r:zd:20142/zd:23037/zd:19621) (q:draft)
