buanzel = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/politics) (w:rape repeatedly/assault repeatedly) (d:<buan>, here the verb wrestle with or rape, and <zel>, repeatedly, written as one word: rape or sexually assault again and again; found in crime reports) (j:buan/zel) (r:zd:21892) (q:draft)
buatbuat = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:hastily/rashly/abruptly) (d:placed after a verb: doing it at once and without thought or restraint, as ordering, accepting, marrying or eating in a rush) (r:zd:12544/zd:14861/zd:26097) (q:draft)
