dop = (i:2) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:be careful/beware/watch out) (d:after <ki> written as a separate word it is <kidop>, be careful or on guard; {ki dop huai} is something to beware of, unlike sparing someone) (s:kidop) (r:zd:24153/zd:22203/zd:14854) (q:draft)
dophuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:health/everyday) (w:calling for care/to be guarded against) (d:written {ki dophuai}, <kidop>, be careful, with <huai>, worthy of: something one ought to be careful about or guard against) (r:zd:14946/zd:22499/zd:17152) (q:draft)
Dopi = (i:1) (t:n) (c:kha) (f:time) (w:April) (d:a month of the traditional Zomi calendar, about April, usually {Dopi kha}; it stands before {Dota} in the list of months; also found as a personal name) (r:ts:479) (q:draft, low confidence)
dopsiamding = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:know how to be careful/should take care) (d:<dop>, <siam> and <ding> written as one word after the prefix <ki>: {ki dopsiamding} is <kidop> {siam ding}, one should know how to be careful) (j:dop/siam/ding) (r:zd:14954/zd:22805) (q:draft)
doptheih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/health) (w:be able to guard against/can take care) (d:<dop> and <theih> written as one word; with <ki>, as in {aki doptheih nadingin}, so that they can be on their guard and take care) (j:dop/theih) (r:zd:14939/zd:14654) (q:draft, low confidence)
doptohna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work) (w:lifting/hoisting) (d:the lifting up of something; {vangik doptohna} is a machine for lifting heavy loads, a crane) (r:zd:14818/zd:14528) (q:draft)
Dormitory = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education/home) (w:dormitory/hostel) (d:a building where students or staff of a school sleep and live) (o:English) (r:zd:14652/zd:15221) (q:draft)
dotcianna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/media) (w:questioning/interrogation/inquiry) (d:<dot>, ask, with <cian>, thoroughly, and the noun suffix {-na}: a thorough questioning, as by the police; {dotcianna nei} is question someone closely, and it is paired with <kancianna>, investigation) (b:dot) (r:zd:12299/zd:14925) (q:draft)
dotdot = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:keep asking/ask again and again) (d:<dot>, ask, said twice: ask on and on, question repeatedly) (b:dot) (r:zd:22858/zd:21826/zd:24847) (q:draft)
dotnop = (i:2) (t:n) (f:everyday/social) (w:question/inquiry) (d:the thing one wants to ask, used as a noun with <nei>, have, or <om>, be there, as in {dotnop na neih leh}, if you have a question; often paired with <kannop> or <telnop> in notices) (r:zd:23005/zd:16136/zd:14921) (q:draft)
Download = (i:1) (t:v) (f:it) (w:download) (d:copy a file or an app from the internet to a phone or computer) (o:English) (r:zd:26097/zd:12441) (q:draft)
downtown = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:downtown/city centre) (d:the central business part of a city, often after the name of the city and before <sung>) (o:English) (r:zd:15531/zd:16612) (q:draft, low confidence)
