ektha = (i:1) (t:v) (f:body) (w:defecate) (d:<ek>, excrement, with a word for let out, also written {ek tha} or {eektha}: pass excrement) (r:zd:17145) (q:draft)
ekthak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:body/health) (w:defecate/relieve oneself) (d:pass excrement, <ek>; paired with <zunthak>, urinate) (r:zd:22959) (q:draft)
ektui = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/home) (w:sewage/sewer water) (d:<ek>, excrement, with <tui>, water: waste water from toilets) (r:zd:14772/zd:17834) (q:draft)
