electricity = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home/work) (w:electricity/electric power) (d:electric power; often added in brackets after <mei>, fire or light, which is used for it in Zolai) (s:mei) (o:English) (r:zd:23077/zd:22584) (q:draft)
