engmel = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/food) (w:yellow colour/yellow) (d:<eng>, yellow, and <mel>, appearance, written as one word: the colour yellow; {a engmel a nei} is that which is yellow) (j:eng/mel) (r:zd:22429/zd:22740) (q:draft)
