ettehhuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:social) (w:exemplary/worth imitating) (d:<etteh>, example, with <huai>, worthy of: worthy to be taken as an example) (b:etteh) (r:zd:16229/zd:11150/zd:21690) (q:draft)
ettehna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education/social) (w:copying/imitation/example) (d:<etteh>, look at and copy, with the noun suffix <na>: the copying of another, as {lai ettehna}, copying in an examination; also the example one sets) (b:etteh) (r:zd:23551/zd:23554) (q:draft)
ettehtaak = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:social) (w:exemplary/worth imitating) (d:<etteh>, example, with <taak>, worthy: worthy to be taken as an example) (s:ettehhuai) (b:etteh) (r:zd:23828/zd:19665) (q:draft)
ettehtak = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:social) (w:exemplary/worth imitating) (d:<etteh>, example, with <tak>, worthy: fit to be taken as an example) (s:ettehhuai) (b:etteh) (j:etteh/tak) (r:zd:20716/zd:9453) (q:draft)
ettheih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:be able to watch/can see) (d:<et>, look, and <theih>, be able, written as one word: be able to look at or watch; {ettheih nadingin} is so that it can be watched) (j:et/theih) (r:zd:21213/zd:20408) (q:draft)
ettheihding = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:media/everyday) (w:to be able to watch/that can be watched) (d:<ettheih> and <ding> written as one word: for watching, that people will be able to watch, said of films and broadcasts) (j:ettheih/ding) (r:zd:11929/zd:12240/zd:25824) (q:draft)
