guahsia = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:rainstorm/heavy rain/storm) (d:<guah>, rain, with <sia>, bad: violent rain; mostly in the pair {huihsia guahsia}, a storm of wind and rain) (r:zd:14547/zd:21563/zd:15942) (q:draft)
guahtam = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:heavy rain/much rain) (d:<guah>, rain, with <tam>, much, written as one word: a great deal of rain) (j:guah/tam) (r:zd:24490/zd:15325) (q:draft)
guahzulo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:nature) (w:not rain/be without rain) (d:<guahzu> and <lo> written as one word: it does not rain, there is no rain) (j:guahzu/lo) (r:zd:11617/zd:19109) (q:draft)
guai = (i:2) (t:intj) (f:everyday/social) (w:friends/folks/mates) (d:word of address to one's equals at the end of a sentence, as in <ei guai>, {maw guai} or {guai aw}: friends, folks; not the verb {guai} hire) (r:zd:25016/zd:25394/zd:17291) (q:draft)
guak = (i:2) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:only) (d:no more than, placed after the word it limits: {khat guak} is only one)
guak = (i:3) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:alone) (d:by oneself, with no one else; follows a pronoun or a name, as {amah guak}, he alone) (s:guakbek/khatguak)
Guaktangphial = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:body) (w:stark naked/completely naked) (d:<guaktang>, naked, with <phial>, quite, written as one word: with no clothes on at all; seen only in one headline, as {guaktangphial in}) (j:guaktang/phial) (r:zd:17575) (q:draft, low confidence)
guaktawh = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:with only/in nothing but) (d:<guak>, only, and <tawh>, with, written as one word after a noun: with that alone, wearing or using nothing else) (j:guak/tawh) (r:zd:20440/zd:16817) (q:draft)
gual = (i:2) (t:n) (f:social) (w:peer/fellow/companion) (d:a person of one's own age or standing, not a row of things; mostly with <lawm>, as in {lawm le gual} or <lawmlegual>, friends and peers, and {gual en} is to envy others) (r:zd:23037/zd:24072/zd:20860) (q:draft)
gual = (i:3) (t:n) (f:time/everyday) (w:about the age of/age group) (d:after <kum> and a number in news reports: of about that age, as in {kum 16 gual}, about sixteen years old; the same as <gualpawl>) (s:gualpawl) (r:ts:6573) (q:draft, low confidence)
gualh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/work) (w:arrange/set in order/list) (d:put things or people in a row or in their proper order, list them one after another; {ki gualh} is be arranged or assigned in turn) (r:zd:24157/zd:22275) (q:draft)
gualleh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (j:guallelh) (r:zd:11403/zd:23639) (q:draft)
guallehna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:defeat/failure/loss) (d:<guallelh>, form of <guallel>, be defeated, with the noun suffix <na>: defeat in a fight or contest, also failure in work or life) (a:gualzawhna) (b:guallel) (r:zd:22755/zd:21876/zd:24248) (q:draft)
guallelte = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:losers/the defeated) (d:plural of <guallel> used as a noun: those who are defeated or who fail, the opposite of <gualzote>, the winners) (b:guallel) (r:zd:22719/zd:20838) (q:draft)
gualpawl = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/time) (w:age group/about the age of) (d:after <kum> and a number: of about that age, in that age group; {kum 30 gualpawl} is about thirty years old, in his or her thirties) (r:zd:16175/zd:14654/zd:11550) (q:draft)
gualsuk = (i:1) (t:v) (f:education/everyday) (w:list/set out/write down in order) (d:<gual>, row, with <suk>, down, written as one word: set things out one below another, list them in writing) (j:gual/suk) (r:zd:21918/zd:24176/zd:26049) (q:draft)
gualte = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:companions/peers/friends) (d:<gual>, a peer or equal, with the plural {-te}: those of the same standing or group; mostly paired with <lawm>, as in {lawm leh gualte}, friends and companions) (r:zd:21925/zd:20794/zd:21151) (q:draft)
gualtung = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:upper hand/top place/prominence) (d:the place above one's peers; mostly in {gualtung tuang}, ride on top: excel, gain the upper hand, be victorious, and {gualtung tuanna}, victory or prominence) (r:zd:21340/zd:24313/zd:17132) (q:draft)
gualtungtuang = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:excel/outdo others/be on top/be superior) (d:<gual>, here one's fellows, with <tungtuang>, excel: be ahead of or above others; before a noun, top-ranking) (r:zd:19964/zd:15622/zd:22037) (q:draft)
gualzawhna ngah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/education/media) (w:win/succeed/gain victory) (d:<gualzawhna>, victory, and <ngah>, get: gain the victory, win a contest, succeed in an effort; said also of passing an examination or completing a degree, with the contest or the means before it) (r:zd:13076/zd:21667/zd:25603) (q:draft)
gualzawhpih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/religion) (w:help to win/give victory) (d:<gualzawh>, win, with <pih>, do together with or for someone: help someone to win or succeed; {hong gualzawhpih} is give us the victory) (j:gualzawh/pih) (r:zd:21268/zd:14791) (q:draft)
guampi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:gorge/ravine/chasm/gulf) (d:<guam>, ravine, with the ending {-pi}, great: a deep valley or gorge that is hard to cross; also said of a gulf that separates and of deep trouble) (b:guam) (r:zd:25045/zd:21100) (q:draft)
