haikhat = (i:1) (t:n) (f:food) (w:one cup/a cup of/a glass of) (d:<hai>, cup, and <khat>, one, written as one word after the name of a drink or other thing measured: one cup of it) (j:hai/khat) (r:zd:24276/zd:22650/zd:17015) (q:draft)
