helthei = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:be able to take part/can join in) (d:written after a separate <ki>: <kihel>, take part, with <thei>, can; {ki helthei} is be able to take part, and in news often simply took part) (r:zd:22565/zd:18076) (q:draft)
