hunteh = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:at the time/when) (d:<hun>, time, with <teh>, written as one word: {tu hunteh} is at this time, nowadays, {tua hunteh} at that time, and {bang hunteh} at what time, when) (j:hun/teh) (r:zd:22479/zd:14930/zd:22860) (q:draft)
