iko = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/religion) (w:we express/we declare) (d:<i>, we, written as one word with the verb of {lungdamna ko}, give thanks, which is a different word from the pronoun <ko>; {lungdamna iko hi} is we give thanks) (j:i/ko) (r:zd:14765/zd:17197) (q:draft)
