kaal = (i:2) (t:n) (f:everyday/time) (w:between/interval/meantime) (d:the space or time between: after two people, what is between them, as <nupa kaal>, between husband and wife; after a verb with <in>, while, as {theih loh kaal-in}, while one does not know) (s:kikal) (r:zd:21293/zd:24056/zd:21673) (q:draft)
