kaamphatna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:good luck/good fortune/luck) (d:<kaam>, luck, with <phatna>, here being good: good fortune; {kaamphatna tawh} is luckily) (b:kaam) (r:zd:21110/zd:22983) (q:draft)
