kaamsiat = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:unlucky/unfortunate) (d:form of <kaamsia>, unlucky, used before words such as <ding>, <leh> and <huai>; set against {kaamphat}, be lucky) (b:kaamsia) (r:zd:24151/zd:12187) (q:draft)
