kaan = (i:2) (t:prep) (f:everyday) (w:more than/beyond/over) (d:placed after an amount, a time or a person: more than that, beyond that, as {nai 3 sung kaan}, longer than three hours, and {nang kaan kuamah}, no one more than you; not the colour word of <kaan.1>) (r:zd:25118/zd:25580/zd:25178) (q:draft)
kaan = (i:3) (t:v) (f:everyday/travel) (w:cross/go over/overtake) (d:go over or past something, as a fence, a border or the people walking ahead; {kaan in} is crossing, going over) (r:zd:21439/zd:21343/zd:26565) (q:draft)
