kadawn = (i:2) (t:v) (f:social/time) (w:I meet/I welcome) (d:<ka>, I, and <dawn>, go to meet, written as one word: I meet or welcome, said here of entering a new year) (j:ka/dawn) (r:zd:25572) (q:draft, low confidence)
kadeih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I want/I wish) (d:<ka>, first person, and <deih>, want, written as one word: I want, we want with <uh>, or what I want) (j:ka/deih) (r:zd:19308/zd:22911/zd:24420) (q:draft)
kadelhpah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:rush to at once/hurry to) (d:<ka> and <delhpah> written as one word: I or we hurried there at once) (j:ka/delhpah) (r:zd:19470/zd:15276) (q:draft)
kadot = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I ask/I asked) (d:<ka> and <dot> written as one word: I ask, used before words such as <leh> and <ciangin>) (j:ka/dot) (r:zd:17731/zd:24595) (q:draft)
kagam = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:my country/our country) (d:<ka>, my, and <gam>, country, written as one word; with <uh>, our country) (j:ka/gam) (r:zd:15163/zd:22938) (q:draft)
kagei = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:my side/beside me) (d:<ka> and <gei>, side, written as one word: the place beside me; {kagei ah} is beside me, next to me) (j:ka/gei) (r:zd:19232/zd:15366) (q:draft)
