kanhuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/media) (w:worth looking into/worth finding out) (d:<kan>, look into, and <huai>, worthy of, written as one word: that ought to be inquired about; often together with <theihhuai>, worth knowing) (j:kan/huai) (r:zd:12257/zd:15433) (q:draft)
kankhiading = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/everyday) (w:will investigate/will find out) (d:<kankhia> and the future marker <ding> written as one word: will search a matter out, will investigate) (j:kankhia/ding) (r:zd:16688/zd:18014/zd:15830) (q:draft)
kankhiapah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/media) (w:search out at once/track down immediately) (d:<kankhia>, search out, and <pah>, at once, written as one word: look for and find a person without delay, said of the police) (j:kankhia/pah) (r:zd:14917/zd:13046) (q:draft)
