kasih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I die/my death) (d:<ka>, I, and <sih>, die, written as one word, before <leh>, <dong> and similar words: {kasih leh} is if I die and {kasih dong} is until I die) (j:ka/sih) (r:zd:19702/zd:25919) (q:draft)
