kasin = (i:1) (t:v) (f:education/everyday) (w:I learn/I study) (d:<ka>, first person marker, and <sin>, learn, written as one word: I learn, I study, or what I have learned) (j:ka/sin) (r:zd:21607/zd:24594) (q:draft)
