lateel = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/religion) (w:selected songs/chosen songs) (d:<la> and <teel> written as one word: songs that have been selected, a selection of songs) (j:la/teel) (r:zd:17634) (q:draft, low confidence)
lathak = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/religion/media) (w:new song) (d:<la>, song, and <thak>, new, written as one word: a new song, a newly composed or newly released song) (j:la/thak) (r:zd:16939/zd:19460/zd:23896) (q:draft)
lathakte = (i:1) (t:n) (f:religion/social) (w:new songs) (d:<la>, song, and <thakte>, new ones, written as one word) (j:la/thakte) (r:zd:17634) (q:draft)
latheiding = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/time) (w:will be able to take/may take) (d:<lathei>, can take, and <ding>, will, written as one word: will be able to take; {hun latheiding} is it may take a length of time) (j:lathei/ding) (r:zd:16334/zd:17848) (q:draft)
lau = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:afraid/frightened/fearful) (d:feeling fear; {lau mahmah} is very afraid) (s:meidawi) (a:hang/lungmuang)
lauding = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:to be feared/frightening/will fear) (d:<lau>, fear, and <ding>, will or to be, written as one word: something to be feared, or will be afraid; {lauding hilo} is not a thing to fear) (j:lau/ding) (r:zd:21869/zd:11477) (q:draft)
lauh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:fear/be afraid) (d:form of <lau> used before <ding>, <nading>, <man> and <dan>; {lauh ding om lo} is there is nothing to fear) (b:lau) (r:zd:20484/zd:23986/zd:24035) (q:draft)
lauhetlo = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:not afraid at all/fearless/unafraid) (d:<lau> and <hetlo> written as one word: not afraid at all; {lauhetlo in} is without any fear) (j:lau/hetlo) (r:zd:20635/zd:15278/zd:14498) (q:draft)
lauhhuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (j:lauhuai) (r:zd:25927/zd:26643/zd:24748) (q:draft)
lauhna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:fear/dread) (d:the feeling of being afraid, also fear that something may happen; {gal lauhna} is fear of war) (s:launa) (r:zd:14916/zd:17685/zd:24804) (q:draft)
lauhuai = (i:2) (t:adj) (f:everyday/health) (w:dangerous/risky/harmful) (d:likely to cause harm, said of a disease, a habit or a thing; with <adingin>, dangerous for someone, and {lauhuai zaw} is more dangerous) (r:zd:21543/zd:21753/zd:24276) (q:draft)
