lungzuan = (i:2) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:be sad/grieve/feel lonely) (d:be heavy at heart from loss or loneliness, not longing for something; also as a noun, sorrow, paired with <khuangaihna>, and {lungzuan huai} is saddening) (r:zd:15695/zd:23902/zd:22749) (q:draft)
