maimai = (i:2) (t:adj) (f:everyday/social) (w:ordinary/common/mere) (d:placed after a noun, as in {mi maimai}, an ordinary person: of no special kind or worth; negated, {maimai lo}, not ordinary, remarkable) (r:zd:22557/zd:11783/zd:21183) (q:draft)
maimit = (i:1) (t:n) (f:body) (w:face/countenance) (d:<mai>, face, and <mit>, eye, as one word: the face and its look; found mostly in songs) (r:zd:24132) (q:draft, low confidence)
main = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (j:manin) (r:zd:15951/zd:24978) (q:draft)
