mainawkna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:offensive/front-line fighting/advance) (d:<mainawk>, meeting the enemy head-on, with the noun suffix {-na}: {gal mainawkna} is a military offensive or front-line battle) (b:mainawk) (r:ts:9093/ts:2963) (q:draft)
