maiphiat = (i:1) (t:v) (f:body/home) (w:wash one's face) (d:<mai>, face, with <phiat>, wipe: wash the face, as part of getting clean in the morning; also as a noun, the washing of the face) (r:zd:25536/zd:24276) (q:draft)
