meileng khawlna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:railway station/train station) (d:<meileng>, train, and <khawlna>, stopping place: the station where trains stop; followed by <ah> for at the station, and often by the name of the station) (r:zd:17861/zd:14694/zd:12040) (q:draft)
meileng lampi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:railway/railway line/railway track) (d:<meileng>, train, and <lampi>, road: the track on which trains run, and a railway line between two places) (r:zd:14888/zd:11901) (q:draft)
