meilengkhat = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:a train/one train) (d:<meileng>, train, and <khat>, one, written as one word: a train) (j:meileng/khat) (r:zd:17659/zd:11901) (q:draft)
meilengpen = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:the train) (d:<meileng>, train, and the topic marker <pen> written as one word: the train, as the topic of the sentence) (j:meileng/pen) (r:zd:19300/zd:19141) (q:draft)
meilengthak = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:travel) (w:new train) (d:<meileng>, train, with <thak>, new, written as one word) (j:meileng/thak) (r:zd:17822/zd:14555) (q:draft)
meilengtung = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:travel) (w:on the train/aboard a train) (d:<meileng>, train, and <tung>, on, written as one word) (j:meileng/tung) (r:zd:20016/zd:21876) (q:draft)
meilet = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/social) (w:policy/principle) (d:found after <thu> as {thu meilet}, the same as <thumeilet> written in two words: the policy, principles or rules that a body or a person holds to; as a verb, hold to a position or account) (r:zd:25022/ts:301) (q:draft, low confidence)
meilum = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home/everyday) (w:warmth of a fire/fire heat) (d:<mei>, fire, with <lum>, warm: the warmth of a fire; {meilum awi} is warm oneself at a fire) (r:zd:17355) (q:draft, low confidence)
meilum = (i:2) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:haze) (d:the haze that hangs over distant hills) (r:zd:22305) (q:draft, low confidence)
meimai = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday/nature) (w:dimly/hazily/blankly) (d:placed after a verb or describing word: dim, dark or hazy, of cloud, smoke, darkness or a clouded head; of people, as in {om meimai} and {tu meimai}, be or sit there blankly, doing nothing) (r:zd:22658/zd:19676) (q:draft, low confidence)
meimual = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:volcano) (d:<mei>, fire, with <mual>, mountain: a mountain that throws out fire; <meimual puakkham> is a volcano erupts) (r:zd:15382/zd:16304/zd:17808) (q:draft)
meimual puakkham = (i:1) (t:v) (f:nature/media) (w:erupt/volcanic eruption) (d:<meimual>, volcano, as the subject of <puakkham>, burst: a volcano erupts; common in news headlines, with the place before it marked by <ah>) (r:zd:19514/zd:11776) (q:draft)
meingong = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family/social) (j:meigong) (r:zd:19630/zd:14930) (q:draft)
meiphelh = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/social) (w:firefighting/fire brigade/firefighter) (d:<mei>, fire, with <phelh>, put out: the putting out of fires, and those whose work it is; <meiphelh mawtaw> is a fire engine and {meiphelh zum} a fire station) (r:zd:15851/zd:23281/zd:20297) (q:draft)
meiphelh mawtaw = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel/work) (w:fire engine/fire truck) (d:<meiphelh>, putting out fire, and <mawtaw>, motor vehicle: a fire engine; a number may follow it) (r:zd:19470/zd:19558/zd:20297) (q:draft)
meiphelhding = (i:1) (t:v) (f:work/everyday) (w:to put out the fire/fight the fire) (d:<mei>, fire, <phelh>, put out, and <ding>, written as one word: in order to put out the fire, mostly as {meiphelhding in}) (j:mei/phelh/ding) (r:zd:17911/zd:14681) (q:draft)
meiphelhna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/social) (w:firefighting/fire extinguishing) (d:<meiphelh>, put out a fire, with the noun suffix <na>: the work of putting out a fire; before the name of a tool, the thing used for it, as a fire extinguisher) (b:meiphelh) (r:zd:14783/zd:12790/zd:20717) (q:draft)
meisah = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home) (w:lighter/cigarette lighter) (d:a small device that is struck to make a flame, built on <mei>, fire) (r:zd:22717) (q:draft)
meisah = (i:2) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:thick fog/dense mist) (d:<mei>, cloud or mist, with <sah>, thick: fog so thick that the road is hard to see) (r:zd:14824) (q:draft, low confidence)
meisan = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:red light/red traffic light) (d:<mei>, light, with <san>, red: the red light of a traffic signal; {meisan ngak} is wait at the red light and {meisan kan} is run the red light) (r:zd:14644/zd:11646/zd:13318) (q:draft)
