milip = (i:2) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:population/inhabitants) (d:all the people of a country or place taken as a number, where the other sense is each one separately; {milip simna} or {milip kisimna} is a census) (r:zd:13070/zd:24064/zd:25248) (q:draft)
Militant = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:militant/armed extremist) (d:member of an armed extremist group; often written beside <migilo>, evildoer) (o:English) (r:zd:15529/zd:13136) (q:draft)
