minampi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:great nation/major people/large ethnic group) (d:<minam>, a people, with <pi>, great: a large or leading people or nation) (b:minam) (r:zd:12341/ts:3160/zd:15772) (q:draft)
minampih = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:fellow tribesman/compatriot/own people) (d:<minam>, people or tribe, with <pih>, fellow: a person of the same people as oneself) (b:minam) (r:zd:19147/zd:21708) (q:draft, low confidence)
