nisimphial = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:every single day/day after day) (d:<nisim>, daily, and the stressing word <phial> written as one word: every day without exception, usually followed by <in>) (j:nisim/phial) (r:zd:12093/zd:19543) (q:draft)
