nuamhi = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:want to/wish to) (d:<nuam>, want, and the sentence-final <hi> written as one word: closes a statement of what someone wants to do) (j:nuam/hi) (r:zd:23022/zd:20905/zd:14579) (q:draft)
