nuamin = (i:3) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:happily/gladly) (d:<nuam>, happy, with the ending {-in}: happily or being glad, not after a verb of action; {lung nuamin} is with a glad heart) (r:zd:23803/zd:20942) (q:draft, low confidence)
