nuamta = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:want to/wish to) (d:<nuam>, want, and the marker <ta> written as one word after a verb: now want to; before a noun, the one who wants to) (j:nuam/ta) (r:zd:15748) (q:draft, low confidence)
