patkhiatna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/travel) (w:origin/starting point) (d:<patkhiat>, start off, with the noun ending <na>: where something starts; after <ki> it is the place a person or thing came from, as in {ki patkhiatna gam}, country of origin) (b:patkhiat) (r:zd:20850/zd:11945) (q:draft)
