pawikhat = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:a festival/a feast) (d:<pawi> and <khat> written as one word: a festival, some feast) (j:pawi/khat) (r:zd:16389/zd:11024) (q:draft)
pawisim = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:attend a festival/keep a festival) (d:<pawi> and <sim> written as one word: go to and take part in a festival; before a noun or <khempeuh>, those who attend it) (j:pawi/sim) (r:zd:21232/zd:15592) (q:draft)
pawisung = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:social/time) (w:during the festival) (d:<pawi>, festival, with <sung>, during, written as one word: in the days of a festival) (j:pawi/sung) (r:zd:13124/zd:11482) (q:draft)
