pawl = (i:2) (t:n) (f:education) (w:grade/standard/class) (d:a class of a school, followed by its number: {pawl 4} is the fourth grade, and {pawl 4 zo} is pass the fourth grade) (r:ts:301) (q:draft, low confidence)
