pawlkhatmah = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:some/quite a few) (d:<pawlkhat>, some, and the emphatic <mah> written as one word: some indeed, a certain number of them) (j:pawlkhat/mah) (r:zd:13190/zd:15840) (q:draft)
