sum khakna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work) (w:money transfer/remittance/sending money) (d:<sum>, money, and <khakna>, sending, from <khak>, send: the sending of money to someone far away, a remittance, and a service or means by which money is sent) (r:zd:10685/zd:25518) (q:draft)
