surau = (i:1) (t:n) (f:religion) (w:surau/Muslim prayer hall) (d:in Malaysia, a small building where Muslims meet to pray, smaller than a mosque; mostly in names and English sentences) (o:Malay) (r:zd:20732) (q:draft, low confidence)
