sut = (i:4) (t:v) (f:health/body) (w:inject/pierce/prick/stab) (d:pierce with something pointed: with <vaccine> or <zatui> it is give or get an injection, and {thal a sut} is an arrow pierces) (r:zd:24276/zd:25231/zd:23022) (q:draft)
sutna = (i:2) (t:n) (f:health) (w:injection/injecting) (d:the giving of medicine or a vaccine through a needle, after <zatui> or <vaccine>; {zatui sutna phim} is the needle of a syringe) (r:zd:21633/zd:24500) (q:draft)
