ta = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family) (w:child) (d:a son or daughter, the child of someone; {ta nei lo} is childless)
taai = (i:3) (t:v) (f:everyday/body) (w:run/flee/run away) (d:a spelling of <tai>, run, with a long vowel: run, or run away from a place or a person, as in {taai mang}, run off, and {taai san}, run away from someone) (s:tai) (r:zd:24230/zd:15337) (q:draft)
