taaklo = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/social) (w:not worthy/not fit/unfit) (d:the negative with <lo> of the word seen in {zuih taak}, worthy to be followed, written as one word after a verb: not fit to be followed, used or asked; compare <kilawm>) (r:zd:23113/zd:24751) (q:draft)
