taalkaihgawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:drag along/drag violently) (d:pull a person, an animal or a thing along the ground by force; <taalkaih>, drag, with <gawp>, severely) (r:zd:15727/zd:15283) (q:draft)
