taangpi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:general public/public/common/general) (d:the people at large, and what is common to all or usual; {a taangpi in} is in general, and the pair <taangpi taangta> is the public at large) (r:zd:25275/zd:19756/zd:11323) (q:draft)
