tabang = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:about each/or so each) (d:placed after a number in a statement of how many per day, per year or per person: about that many each time; <ta>, each, with <bang>, about) (j:ta/bang) (r:zd:12746/zd:15617/zd:16068) (q:draft)
