taihinn = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home) (w:brick building/masonry house/concrete building) (d:a house or building of brick or concrete, as against a wooden house; the first part is from Burmese taik, brick building, the second is <inn>, house) (r:zd:22586/zd:20936/ts:301) (q:draft)
