taikekgawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:flee in panic/run away in all directions/scatter) (d:<taikek>, run away in haste, with <gawp>, which shows that the act is done wildly and completely: run for one's life in panic) (j:taikek/gawp) (r:zd:12915/zd:14875) (q:draft)
