Tedim Labu = (i:1) (t:name) (f:religion) (w:Tedim Hymnal/Tedim hymn book) (d:<Tedim> with <labu>, hymn book: the hymnal in the Tedim language used in the churches; a hymn is cited by its number after the name) (r:ts:301/zd:19156) (q:draft)
