teen = (i:2) (t:n) (f:home) (w:clothing/clothes) (d:only in the pair {silh le teen} or {silh leh teen}, what is put on and what is wrapped round the body: clothing as a whole, with <silh>, wear; not {teen}, dwell) (r:zd:22496/zd:10777/zd:24123) (q:draft)
