telloh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/education) (w:not understand/not understood) (d:<tel> and the negative <loh> written as one word: not understanding, or what is not understood; {telloh a om leh} is if there is anything not understood) (j:tel/loh) (r:zd:15881/zd:20875) (q:draft)
