thai = (i:3) (t:n) (f:travel/politics) (w:Thai/Thailand) (d:the country of Thailand or its people, written with a capital letter, mostly before words such as <gamsung>, <kumpi>, <gammi> and <gam>; not the day after tomorrow) (s:Thaigam) (r:zd:17239/zd:15745/zd:11931) (q:draft)
