Thaigam = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel/politics) (w:Thailand) (d:{Thai} with <gam>, country: the country of Thailand) (s:Thailand) (r:zd:18017) (q:draft)
Thailand = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel/politics) (w:Thailand) (d:country in Southeast Asia, east of Myanmar) (r:zd:20889/zd:19100/zd:19285) (q:draft)
