to = (i:4) (t:part) (f:everyday) (w:on/onward/further) (d:placed after a verb to show that the action goes on or moves forward step by step and not upward: {zom to} is continue on, and the doubled {to to} with <zel> is keep on doing) (r:zd:23489/zd:17574) (q:draft)
