tutpihna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/religion) (w:condolence gathering/wake/memorial gathering) (d:<tutpih>, sit with, with the noun suffix <na>: a gathering in which people sit with a bereaved family to comfort them, also held by video call; {hehnep tutpihna} is a gathering of comfort) (b:tutpih) (r:zd:20305/zd:25178/zd:24029) (q:draft)
tutunga = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:this time/on this occasion) (d:<tu>, this, with <tunga>: of this time, this time's, placed before a noun or before <pen>) (j:tu/tunga) (r:zd:25668/zd:15805) (q:draft, low confidence)
tutungpen = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time/everyday) (w:this time/as for this time) (d:<tu>, now, <tung>, time or occasion, and the topic marker <pen>, written as one word: this time, set against earlier times) (j:tu/tung/pen) (r:zd:12271/zd:16406) (q:draft)
tuu = (i:2) (t:v) (f:social/politics) (w:renew/extend) (d:make a card or permit valid for a further time, used after <tettan>: {tettan tuu} is renew, and {tettan tuu nailo} is not yet renewed) (r:zd:23471) (q:draft, low confidence)
